sequenceDiagram
 participant Staff
 participant Server as SvelteKit server
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 Staff->>Server: Change status
 Server->>Server: Verify session and permissions
 Server->>DB: BEGIN
 Server->>DB: SELECT ticket FOR UPDATE
 Server->>Server: Check ticket access and allowed change
 Server->>DB: UPDATE ticket
 Server->>DB: INSERT ticket_event
 Server->>DB: INSERT notifications when required
 alt Both successful
  Server->>DB: COMMIT
 else Any failure
  Server->>DB: ROLLBACK
 end
